#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:4
msgid "Chain 8Servos2"
msgstr "Chain 8Servos2"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:10
msgid ""
"The ``Servos8V2Chain`` class controls the Unit 8Servos2-Chain through a "
"``ChainBus``. The device provides eight configurable channels for GPIO "
"input, GPIO output, ADC, servo, RGB, and PWM operation. It also provides "
"power monitoring, UID, firmware, bootloader, and device type APIs."
msgstr ""
"``Servos8V2Chain`` 类通过 ``ChainBus`` 控制 Unit 8Servos2-Chain。设备提供八个可配置通道，支持 "
"GPIO 输入、GPIO 输出、ADC、舵机、RGB 和 PWM 功能，还提供电源监测、UID、固件版本、引导程序版本和设备类型相关 API。"

