#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:20
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常量"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:22
msgid "Use the following constants with ``set_channel_mode()``:"
msgstr "以下常量用于 ``set_channel_mode()``："

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:24
msgid "``MODE_INPUT``: GPIO input mode."
msgstr "``MODE_INPUT``：GPIO 输入模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:25
msgid "``MODE_OUTPUT``: GPIO output mode."
msgstr "``MODE_OUTPUT``：GPIO 输出模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:26
msgid "``MODE_ADC``: ADC input mode."
msgstr "``MODE_ADC``：ADC 输入模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:27
msgid "``MODE_SERVO``: Servo control mode."
msgstr "``MODE_SERVO``：舵机控制模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:28
msgid "``MODE_RGB``: RGB output mode for WS2812 LEDs."
msgstr "``MODE_RGB``：用于 WS2812 灯珠的 RGB 输出模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:29
msgid "``MODE_PWM``: PWM duty output mode."
msgstr "``MODE_PWM``：PWM 占空比输出模式。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:31
msgid "Use ``PULL_NONE``, ``PULL_UP``, or ``PULL_DOWN`` with ``set_input_pull()``."
msgstr "调用 ``set_input_pull()`` 时可使用 ``PULL_NONE``、``PULL_UP`` 或 ``PULL_DOWN``。"

#: ../../../source/chain/servos8_v2.rst:36
msgid ""
"Channels 0-3 share one PWM frequency, and channels 4-7 share another. "
"Setting the frequency of one channel changes every channel in the same "
"group. Selecting servo mode sets the channel's shared group to 50 Hz."
msgstr ""
"通道 0-3 共享一个 PWM 频率，通道 4-7 共享另一个 PWM "
"频率。设置任一通道的频率会改变同组所有通道的频率。选择舵机模式时，会将该通道所在共享频率组设置为 50 Hz。"

